@startuml phase0-contract-freeze-call-flow
title Phase 0 — Contract freeze: verification call flow (R1–R4)

note across
Runtime hops these contracts govern (frozen here, exercised in Phases 1–6):
bench —R1 CPM/UPER→ V2X ECU —R2 JSON/UDP→ ADA ECU (R3 store) —R4 JSON/UDP→ IVI
R5/R6 smoke test: adopted from plans/doc/research_notes/baseline-connectivity-smoke-test.md (C1–C5, M1–M12) — not re-drawn here.
Contract source-of-truth folder: contracts/ (user-approved 2026-07-30 — HLD §3 D1).
end note

box "Contract source of truth"
participant "contracts/" as SRC
end box
box "V2X_ECU/ (C++17)"
participant "gv_tool\n(tools/golden_vectors)" as GV
participant "VanetzaCpmCodec\n(src/codec, r2::Cpm only)" as CODEC
participant "V2X tests" as VT
end box
box "ADA_ECU/"
participant "core tests (C++)" as AT
participant "detector tests (Python)" as ADT
end box
box "Scenario_Player/"
participant "bench tests (Python)" as BT
end box
box "IVI_ECU/"
participant "model tests (Kotlin)" as IT
end box

== Author ==
[-> SRC : commit r1-cpm-profile.md,\nr1..r4 schemas, samples/

== Generate golden vectors (R1 codec seam) ==
SRC -> GV : <case>.json (CpmContent,\nper r1-cpm-content.schema.json)
GV -> CODEC : encode(CpmContent)
CODEC --> GV : ASN.1 UPER bytes
GV -> CODEC : decode(bytes)
CODEC --> GV : CpmContent'
GV -> GV : assert CpmContent == CpmContent'
GV -> SRC : write golden-vectors/<case>.json + <case>.uper

== Sync node-local copies ==
SRC -> SRC : check_sync.py — byte-identity of every copy\nper sync-manifest.json + F2 grep ban

== Round-trip tests per consumer language ==
SRC -> VT : fixtures: golden/, samples/r2-object.json
VT -> CODEC : decode(<case>.uper) == <case>.json
VT -> VT : R2 struct <-> JSON round-trip (nlohmann)

SRC -> AT : fixtures: samples/ (all five)
AT -> AT : R2 / R3 / R4 round-trips (nlohmann)
AT -> AT : r4-unknown-warning.json parses,\nclassified unknown — no failure (R4 additive)

SRC -> ADT : fixtures: samples/
ADT -> ADT : R3 JSONL round-trip +\njsonschema validation of shared samples

SRC -> BT : fixtures: golden-vectors *.json side
BT -> BT : CpmContent round-trip\n(wire-native units)

SRC -> IT : fixtures: samples/ (r3 + r4)
IT -> IT : R4 warning/state round-trip (kotlinx)
IT -> IT : r4-unknown-warning.json degrades\ngracefully (R4 additive)

== Freeze ==
[-> SRC : contracts frozen — Phases 1–6 build against them;\nany change re-freezes across every consumer
@enduml
